{"id":"29a3b60439beb1f3","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CurryDenote.md","title":"CurryDenote","display":"CurryDenote","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"CurryDenote","parameters":["g","t","a","annotated","eta","e","v"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"CurryDenote"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>t</span><span>a</span><span>annotated</span><span>eta</span><span>e</span><span>v</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：Curry 简单类型算法。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>a</code>、<code>annotated</code>、<code>eta</code>、<code>e</code>、<code>v</code>。</p>\n<p>显式保留所选 Church 注解/类型推导见证，不声称无类型项自带唯一类型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ CurryDenote g t a annotated eta e v)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists w\n  (exists empty\n    (and\n      (@ Omega w)\n      (and\n        (@ Empty empty)\n        (and\n          (@ STErase annotated t)\n          (and (@ STType w empty empty g annotated a) (@ STDenote w empty empty eta empty g annotated a e v)))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b6471a8f381739eb\" href=\"?note=b6471a8f381739eb\" title=\"ZFC_Empty\">Empty</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a6bf8d66277e0319\" href=\"?note=a6bf8d66277e0319\" title=\"ZFC_STDenote\">STDenote</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0b9755cda5f84d06\" href=\"?note=0b9755cda5f84d06\" title=\"ZFC_STErase\">STErase</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ed545317bea3234d\" href=\"?note=ed545317bea3234d\" title=\"ZFC_STType\">STType</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ CurryDenote g t a annotated eta e v)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Empty","status":"resolved","id":"b6471a8f381739eb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_STDenote|STDenote]]；[[ZFC_STErase|STErase]]；[[ZFC_STType|STType]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Omega","status":"resolved","id":"3bcf6cd1d43a3007","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_STDenote|STDenote]]；[[ZFC_STErase|STErase]]；[[ZFC_STType|STType]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_STDenote","status":"resolved","id":"a6bf8d66277e0319","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_STDenote|STDenote]]；[[ZFC_STErase|STErase]]；[[ZFC_STType|STType]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_STErase","status":"resolved","id":"0b9755cda5f84d06","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_STDenote|STDenote]]；[[ZFC_STErase|STErase]]；[[ZFC_STType|STType]]","embed":false},{"target":